<title>ARGENTINA: RALLYING-MAKINEN WINS ARGENTINE RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-MAKINEN WINS ARGENTINE RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>CORDOBA, Argentina 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reigning world rally champion Tommi Makinen of Finland, driving a Mitsubishi, won the Rally of Argentina on Saturday.</p>
<p>Briton Colin McRae came second in a Subaru while Swede Kenneth Eriksson also in a Subaru, finished third.</p>
